   "address": 1031,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Loads the next level's two files and starts them. Calls the prompt at $0625, then the file loader at $0436 with the file-name pointer for level number $0435, repeats while the error flag $0624 is set, then increments the level number and jumps to the level's entry at $0A20."
  },
  {
   "address": 1077,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Number of the next level to load, 0 to 5, read by the loader loop at $0407 and the prompt at $0625."
  },
  {
   "address": 1078,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Stores the file-name pointer from A (low) and Y (high) at $04BE and $04BF, then runs the fast loader at $0493."
  },
  {
   "address": 1087,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Low bytes of the six per-level file-name pointers, indexed by $0435."
  },
  {
   "address": 1093,
