   "text": "High bytes of the six per-level file-name pointers, indexed by $0435."
  },
  {
   "address": 1548,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "\"DISC ERROR\", shown by the loader when a load fails."
  },
  {
   "address": 1572,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Set when a load fails; makes $0625 show the disk prompt again and $0407 retry the load."
  },
  {
   "address": 1573,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Screen shown between levels. Banks the KERNAL in ($01=$37), sets a text screen at $0400, and prints either the disk-side prompt (before level 1, before level 4, and after an error) or the next-level prompt, then waits for fire on joystick port 2 ($DC00)."
  },
  {
   "address": 1713,
