  {
   "address": 1754,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "\"PRESS FIRE TO LOAD NEXT LEVEL\", shown before levels 2, 3, 5 and 6."
  },
  {
   "address": 45256,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Silences the sound chip: clears the resonance and filter routing at $D417, sets volume 15 at $D418, and zeroes all 21 voice registers $D400-$D414 together with the driver's shadow table at $B02F. Level 1 puts the driver here at run time from its own file (a copy of the bytes at $7543); the level loads after it leave $9A00-$BEFF alone, and level 2 calls it at $5491."
  },
  {
   "address": 45430,
